  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Australia Awards (in-country costs) - 2023 to 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides support for the implementation of the Australia Awards (and Pacific) Scholarship Program in Kiribati. It covers all costs within the different stages of the scholarship cycle starting from advertisements, awareness/promotional activities, scholarship assessment related costs (i.e. screening, interviews, English language testing, etc.) and up to mobilisation of selected cohorts.</narrative>
  </description>
